{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33698","headline":"苦雨 · 林宽","name":"苦雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霪霖翳日月，穷巷变沟坑。\n骤洒纤枝折，奔倾坏堵平。\n蒙[簦]来客绝，跃甃噪蛙狞。\n败屐阴苔积，摧檐湿菌生。\n斜飞穿裂瓦，迸落打空铛。\n叶底迟归蝶，林中滞出莺。\n润侵书缝黑，冷浸鬓丝明。\n牖暗参差影，堦寒断续声。\n尺薪功比桂，寸粒价高琼。\n遥想管弦里，无因识此情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林宽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33698.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33698","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}